Step 1 – Create project folder
Open VS Code.

Create a folder named:

node_lab

Open this folder in VS Code.

Step 2 – Create JavaScript file
Inside node_lab, create:

server.js

Step 3 – Open terminal
Open VS Code terminal using:

Ctrl + ~

Check your location:
pwd


Make sure you are inside node_lab.

Step 4 – Check Node.js
Run:
node -v